  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1505.01 Rebate Application Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1505.01 Rebate Application Procedures.\n\n(a) Applicants shall submit a rebate application by:\n\n(1) Providing all information required by Env-Dw 1505.02, either in writing or on form NHDES-W-03-282;\n\n(2) Signing and certifying a rebate application as required by Env-Dw 1505.03; and\n\n(3) Submitting a completed original rebate application:\n\na. Electronically, per the instructions in the rebate application available for use on the department’s website at www.pfas.des.nh.gov; or\n\nb. By delivery in writing to:\n\nNHDES PFAS Rebate Program\n\n29 Hazen Drive\n\nP.O. Box 95\n\nConcord, NH 03302-0095\n\n(b) A separate rebate application is required for each residential address.\n\nSource. #14201, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1500.html"
}
